  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing food with compassion to refugees, Greece</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">foodKIND runs a free market in Athens, Greece, at which we support refugees and asylum seekers who are food insecure. We provide dried and tinned goods, as well as some hygiene items. We are currently supporting about 400 people, who go through a needs assessment according to a set of vulnerability criteria. There has been a sharp increase in the need for food amongst the community of forcibly displaced people. We are raising funds to expand our project and help as many people as possible.</narrative>
  </description>
